0afedeb70\" />\n\nHowever, the MRP contains a `.godot` folder that displays different UVs:\n\nUV1 view | UV2 view\n-|-\n<img width=\"324\" height=\"364\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/74427055-8a2d-4820-ac8e-9a0dbe1120c8\" /> | <img width=\"315\" height=\"353\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1e5d688a-5895-44a8-b73e-2490afedeb70\" />\n\nThis is what it looks like in Blender:\n\nBlender `UVMap` and `UVMap.001` | Blender `UVMap.002`\n-|-\n<img width=\"270\" height=\"282\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b65e6362-cfef-40b8-b51f-2829598129e9\" /> | <img width=\"270\" height=\"282\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae4ea76e-e6c5-4351-8e91-3d2c8ca70163\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5401677233/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5426873193","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120156#issuecomment-5426873193","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120156","id":5426873193,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQ3eDaQ","user":{"login":"floweeng","id":104648756,"node_id":"U_kgDOBjzQNA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104648756?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/floweeng","html_url":"https://github.com/floweeng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floweeng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floweeng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floweeng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floweeng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floweeng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floweeng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floweeng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floweeng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/floweeng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-26T14:33:06Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T14:33:06Z","body":"<img width=\"1114\" height=\"569\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd25dcbf-9785-4cca-820e-def52354cbf7\" />\n\nAs I further investigate it, I can see the same issue when I set up the export option to \"Export\". If you set it to \"Viewport\", the issue gone no matter how you set up your blender shader.\n\nGiven that this is manageable with simple setup and Blender shader doesn't match to Godot's one-to-one anyway, it is safe to close this.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5426873193/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]